[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500100_04_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500100_04_0010","text":"雾子—\n那个，是什么—？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500100_04_0020","text":"嗯……\n飘进来了……红叶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500100_04_0030","text":"哼……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500100_04_0040","text":"那片红叶，好漂亮呢～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500100_04_0050","text":"呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500100_04_0060","text":"要……送它回外面……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500100_04_0070","text":"走吧～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500100_04_0080","text":"摩美美也一起去吧～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500100_04_0090","text":"诶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500100_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500100_04_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500100_04_0100","text":"……嘛，也不是不行啦—"}]
